### Props
| Prop | Type | Default | Description |
|------|------|---------|-------------|
| name | string | 'Alexander Doe' | Name shown on the card. |
| role | string | 'Senior Developer' | Role shown under the name. |
| badge | string | 'Verified' | Label of the badge in the top left corner. |
| status | string | 'Active' | Label of the status chip in the top right corner. |
| statusColor | string | '#22c55e' | Color of the status dot. |
| idLabel | string | 'ID number' | Small label above the ID number. |
| idValue | string | '8901 2345 6789' | ID number shown in the footer. |
| children | ReactNode | - | Custom content for the card. Replaces the badge, name and footer. |
| theme | 'dark' | 'light' | 'dark' | Dark graphite or light silver metal, with matching text. |
| videoSrc | string | - | Looping video the card reflects when the camera is off. Without one it reflects a soft studio. |
| webcam | boolean | false | Reflects the camera feed, mirrored. Asks for camera access and falls back to the video. |
| onWebcamError | (error: Error) => void | - | Called when camera access is denied or unavailable. |
| tint | string | '#ffffff' | Color of the metal. White gives plain steel. |
| metalness | number | 1 | How strongly the surface mirrors the scene, from 0 to 1. At 0 the card turns matte. |
| roughness | number | 0.3 | Brushed grain of the metal, from 0 to 1. Stretches reflections along the grain. |
| blurStrength | number | 6 | Blur of the reflection, in px. |
| grayscale | number | 1 | Removes color from the reflection, from 0 to 1. Lower it to see the scene in color. |
| warp | number | 0.6 | Gentle bends in the surface that ripple the reflection. |
| warpScale | number | 1 | Size of the bends. |
